<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3635/40  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5535/40  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7435/40  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3433/43  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.00/04   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.2420/50  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1528.8/9.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.86/96  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.8506/81  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4573/93  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.9405/55  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.3994/04  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7954/61  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7372/82  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6750/60</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$369.35/369.85</p>
</text>
